 : Int' is a one-field wrapper on Int — it carries neither the normal form, the smoothing sequence, nor k, so it does not formalise the .md's L = k; (ii) 'lepton_number_conservation' sums (s.charged + s.neutral) over a list of SkeinSmoothing, but pair_conservation : charged + neutral = 0 is a FIELD of that structure, so the summand is identically zero by hypothesis and the theorem is 'a sum of zeros is zero'. The conservation is assumed in the carrier rather than derived — the self-assuming-projection shape of AGENTS.md 3b-cond item 5. The induction is real, so this is an observation, not a vacuity call.","history":2},{"id":"trap-nonspeakable","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-22","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","notes":"no trap of this class; full-context read","history":2},{"id":"trap-performed-warmth","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-22","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","notes":"no trap of this class; full-context read","history":2},{"id":"trap-rhetorical-pivot","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-22","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","notes":"no trap of this class; full-context read","history":2},{"id":"trap-superlative","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-22","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","notes":"no trap of this class; full-context read","history":2},{"id":"trap-thesis-restatement","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-22","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","notes":"no trap of this class; full-context read","history":2},{"id":"trap-triples","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-22","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","notes":"no trap of this class; full-context read"